    "body": "P1 · effort:high · area:3d, area:ui (triage, maintainer-filed defect) - a facing op generated from Setup2 uses the wrong WCS orientation (\"faces the wrong face\", stock top/clearance drawn from Setup1): wrong toolpath against a real machine, gouge risk - P1 row, safety floor at least effort:high. Diagnosis first: which seam reads the non-active setup's WCS in machine preview and in generate (setup::wcs_slot per memory is the one reader).\n",
