    "updated_at": "2026-11-13T21:18:18Z",
    "body": "Checked headlessly on the 0.19.0 release build (`camcraft-cli mcp`, `testdata/models/box.step`): Setup1 square, Setup2 with `set_wcs` turned 90 deg about X, a Face operation in each. `generate` returns `ok` for both, with the same 4 moves and no warning; `verify` reports no finding. So the report reproduces on 0.19.0: the tilt is accepted and then ignored. The refusal of PR 1518 is on main only; it was not run here because no build newer than 0.19.0 is in `dist`.",
